{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Kings</strong> is a cozy yet challenging <strong>roguelike tower defense</strong> set in a world without rulers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068430/extras/d86a034d11284c8ee81081aaec2a01ce.poster.avif?t=1768477284\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068430/extras/d86a034d11284c8ee81081aaec2a01ce.webm?t=1768477284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068430/extras/d86a034d11284c8ee81081aaec2a01ce.mp4?t=1768477284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, defend, and adapt as waves of strange enemies test your strategy. Each run is unique \u2014 new upgrades, random paths, and unpredictable encounters make every defense different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068430/extras/b6213c6ee6cc82eae55ed0ac266f52d2.poster.avif?t=1768477284\" width=640 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068430/extras/b6213c6ee6cc82eae55ed0ac266f52d2.webm?t=1768477284\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068430/extras/b6213c6ee6cc82eae55ed0ac266f52d2.mp4?t=1768477284\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gold, unlock powerful towers, and experiment with endless combinations to find your perfect strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to start, hard to master \u2014 one mistake and your kingdom falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_